<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM THE MEN'S CZECH INDOOR OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM THE MEN'S CZECH INDOOR OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>first round of the $475,000 men's Czech Indoor Open on Monday.</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 7-6 (7-3),</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Alex Radelescu (Germany) beat Petr Luxa (Czech Republic) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3), 7-5</p>
</text>
